  triage:highestFixedBranch "" ;
  triage:correctionNote "2026-07-22: promote_to_branch and highestOpenBranch corrected from feature/pAI-s17-hermes-chat-identity to feature/pAI-s16-offline-reconciliation. arch-ctm caught scope-boundary conflict: AI.17 (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-17-hermes-chat-identity.md) is scoped strictly to the ambient chat-context resolver and forbids daemon/canonical-router/storage changes. All occurrences (peer.rs peer_sync_policy/save_peer_sync_policy, runtime_health.rs peer_sync_cooldown/reconcile_after_success) are AI.16 deliverables (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-16-offline-reconciliation.md). Original mis-target was applied via unverified highest-open-branch heuristic." .

